 "text": "Hey! How's life treating you? Mostly by keeping the food away from where they sleep. Hang the food way up in a tree or on high rock where bear can't reach. About hundred meters is usually enough, so they can smell it but can't get to it. Stop cooking, make lot of noise, and don't run. Back away slowly and don't leave food out again. If it's really bothering the group, a bear bag helps. It is, but it' worth it for the whole group.",
